%% Diagram: Claim Source Verification Workflow
%% ID: ECOMDY-D20 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal, not as-built
flowchart LR
  claim["Extracted claim + source span"] --> locate["Locate linked source version"]
  locate --> authority{"Approved / authoritative evidence?"}
  authority -->|No| unresolved["Unresolved · do not assert as fact"]
  authority -->|Yes| compare["Compare wording, values and dates"]
  compare --> state{"Evidence result"}
  state -->|Supports| supported["Supported with citation"]
  state -->|Conflicts| contradicted["Contradicted · escalate"]
  state -->|Out of date| stale["Stale / effective period ended"]
  supported --> review["Human review for high-impact claims"]
  contradicted --> review
  stale --> review
